      <Docs>
        <summary>
            Eventual consistency - reads from a single random secondary replica.
            This strategy also covers  <see cref="F:Microsoft.Azure.Cosmos.ConsistencyLevel.ConsistentPrefix" /> consistency level behavior,
            as both use the same underlying read mechanism (single replica read).
            </summary>
      </Docs>
